    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.rubric.1",
      "source_sha256": "4e662e51912e0a4a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "The martyrdom of Jacob the priest and of Mary his sister, a woman of the covenant."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s1",
      "source_sha256": "92229735a5694730",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "In the seventh year of our persecution, Jacob, the priest of the village of Tel Shlila, was arrested,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s2",
      "source_sha256": "75910f0bcfc52c1a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "along with Mary his sister, a woman of the covenant, by order of Narses Tamsapor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s3",
      "source_sha256": "003c31aa0d8b0005",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "He tortured them with severe blows and merciless floggings, wanting to make them eat blood."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s4",
      "source_sha256": "70df8c6c2106fb8a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "But they strengthened their hands in their God and looked to him with a pure and upright heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s5",
      "source_sha256": "5c6098f338ef7b45",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "They called on him as a helper in their [?], and asked him for strength and help."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s6",
      "source_sha256": "5d7691fdefc46e25",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "When that rebel saw that they would not abandon their truth in any way,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s7",
      "source_sha256": "6ec196b02e7ca866",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "he ordered a certain freeborn layman named Mahdad,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s8",
      "source_sha256": "9ca34eabd81ceb84",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "who was called a Christian in name but not in deeds, to go out and behead them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s9",
      "source_sha256": "049039536fb03f81",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "To win his favor, this man brought death upon his own life and cut off his hope for the sake of this present time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s10",
      "source_sha256": "05a286ec6768075a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "He went out and cut off both their heads with a sword in the village of Tel Dara, on the Great Zab."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/martyrdom-of-jacob-and-mary#DSC387.0.s11",
      "source_sha256": "8e16779719731748",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 12,
      "text": "The saints were crowned on the seventeenth of the lunar month of Adar."
    }
  ]
}
